   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><strong>Discuss the evolution of Operating Systems across different generations, highlighting key technological advancements and operating system features.</strong></span></span></p>\n",
